ons Rules Connect With Us Contact Facebook Feedback FAQ Feedback Contact USC Transportation Need to purchase a permit? Permits are on sale now! Buy Parking Permit Getting to/from LAX Heading out for the break? Take Metro! Travel to LAX Information Campus Rescue is USC Transportation’s preferred roadside assistance provider, offering 24/7/365 vehicle protection and services designed specifically for colleges and universities. Whether you’re on campus, off campus, or anywhere nationwide, help is always just a call away. Access Campus Rescue Program Student U-Pass program All students are eligible for a FREE U-pass, allowing free rides on all Metro services! Sign up for yours today! U-Pass Information Lyft Program Need an evening ride around the UPC or HSC campus? Our partnership with Lyft provides free Shared rides around each campus to current USC faculty, staff and students. Access Lyft Program Informtation USC Buses Wondering where your USC Bus is? Download our tracking app to track our most popular routes! Bus Tracking App Football Parking The 2026 USC Football Season is here! We have all you need to know about tailgates, parking and more! Football Gameday Information Drive an electric vehicle? View our charging locations and rates here. Learn More USC Lyft Rides Program Powered by Campus Cruiser, and supplemented by LYFT, our Rides Program is designed to make the USC Community a safer place for those who study, work, or take classes at night. USC Lyft Rides Parking Whether you are visiting for the day or staying for a semester, we have parking options to suit your needs. You can even book online before you arrive. Parking at USC Parking Reservations USC Buses Our many bus routes will move you around campus, between campuses or into the greater Los Angeles community - including Union Station. About USC Buses Bus Schedules Sustainability We believe in a sustainable approach to transportation whether it be through our "green" campus cruisers, variety of ride-sharing